My vegetarian chaotic elven priestess, tumult came upon a general store
in Dlvl 2 with an amazing array of stuff:
- food rations, very useful for a vegetarian!
- +1 gloves of dexterity
- speed boots
- scrolls, spellbooks, potions, etc.

I was feeling very hopeful about this game!

So I stole all of the stuff using a bug in the game involving
containers.  Then I started quaffing unknown potions.  One of them made
me levitation.  The next one polymorphed me in to a winter wolf cub.  I
decided to pick a fight with the hidden mimic so that he would kill me
and make me regain my form.  I succeeded in turning back in to elven
form, but all my weapons were still on the ground, unreachable because
I was still levitating!

I should have just dodged the mimic until I came to the floor, but I
decided I needed to start killing the mimic.  So I zapped an unknown
wand at him.  It turned out to be a polymorph wand, so I ruined my Mace
and all my armor which was lying on the ground, AND the store-owner got
angry!!!!  With the wand of polymorph, I managed to kill the
store-keeper and live (store-keeper -> trapper -> lich -> some
invisible thing that I killed)...

But the grief of losing my awesome equipment made me just quit.  Oh
well, it was only Dlvl 2



